 ## Overview
-This method precomputes the geometric properties (area and volume) of all possible contours for a 3D scalar field, enabling real-time evaluation for any selected isovalue without expensive surface extraction [S1]. It differs from post-extraction methods by using a contour tree to hierarchically aggregate B-spline functions, allowing immediate quantification of topological features [S1].
